1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 6]

3
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:03,430
Come on.

4
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,310
Check that room.

5
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:11,750
He's gone.

6
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,870
He left everything. He fled in a hurry.

7
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:19,280
He knew we'd exposed him.

8
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,840
He even left his women's clothes.

9
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,840
[Hongyuan Phone Repair]

10
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:27,800
Uncle He.

11
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:28,800
Take a look.

12
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,520
Yu Hongfei was hiding something.

13
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:37,470
He's another target
of Jiang Li's revenge.

14
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,590
Jiang Li is acting as himself this time.

15
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:41,360
That means Yu is the final target.

16
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:42,960
Issue an alert.

17
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,150
Don't let him get away.

18
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,630
Yes.

19
00:02:53,630 --> 00:02:54,080
Hello?

20
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:55,000
It's me.

21
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,520
Do you remember?

22
00:02:56,630 --> 00:02:56,960
You...

23
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,120
You're still alive?

24
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,400
I didn't die.
Someone sent me to help you.

25
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:02,190
Where are you now?

26
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:03,470
I'm at the shop.

27
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,560
Call me when you reach Furong Alley.

28
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,240
How long till you get here?

29
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,560
- Five minutes.
- You'd better hurry.

30
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,190
Okay, okay. I'm leaving now.

31
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:11,630
No.

32
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,280
Boss, where are you taking me?

33
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,470
Five minutes. I won't wait.

34
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,190
You're awake.

35
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:00,590
Bro.

36
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,400
Is there a mix-up?

37
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:05,750
I never wronged you.

38
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:06,800
Yeah.

39
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,360
You never wronged me.

40
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:08,960
Hey, bro.

41
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,960
Brother, stay calm.

42
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,630
Don't do anything rash.

43
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:14,680
At least tell me why
you brought me here.

44
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:18,390
Two years in prison can't
erase what you did.

45
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:19,680
No.

46
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:21,190
I've turned over a new leaf.

47
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,950
Go ask the police.

48
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,270
If I did something wrong before,

49
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,950
I'll pay you.

50
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:28,630
Name your price.

51
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,360
Xiao Ting.

52
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,160
Do you remember her?

53
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:33,560
She's my sister.

54
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,270
It's you.

55
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,270
You.

56
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,000
You killed Lao Zou and Dongzi.

57
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:40,240
No.

58
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,560
Your sister's death had
nothing to do with me.

59
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,950
I was just security at the club.

60
00:04:43,950 --> 00:04:44,560
It was...

61
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,310
Zou Jun.

62
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:47,120
He took her to Xu Haodong
to curry favor with him.

63
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,070
Really, really, really.

64
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:49,270
It really had nothing to do with me.

65
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,190
He got away.

66
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:10,240
We were one step too late.

67
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:12,950
Notify Ren Fei and the traffic unit.

68
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,160
Have them assist immediately.

69
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:14,720
Yes.

70
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:15,950
Find them fast.

71
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:17,480
Let's go.

72
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,920
I repaid all the pain

73
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,480
my sister suffered.

74
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,630
Now,

75
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:39,000
you're the only one left.

76
00:05:39,950 --> 00:05:42,830
Don't kill me. Please!

77
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,560
Don't worry. I won't
let you die quickly.

78
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,720
You...

79
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,800
What do you want from me?

80
00:05:58,630 --> 00:06:01,160
Don't men love forcing women to obey?

81
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,630
Move again,

82
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,120
and my next hammer blow

83
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:05,630
will land on your head.

84
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:10,480
I've wanted to be a
girl since childhood.

85
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,560
Then my sister told me

86
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:16,160
that being a woman is hard.

87
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:17,190
Of course.

88
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,950
You'd have to be

89
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,390
a real woman to understand that.

90
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,310
Right?

91
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:22,950
Wait.

92
00:06:22,950 --> 00:06:24,000
Bro.

93
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:27,160
Don't you want to know
where your sister is?

94
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,160
My sister is dead.

95
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,630
She is.

96
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:31,190
But don't you want to find her body

97
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,560
and lay her to rest?

98
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,800
Only I know.

99
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,800
If I die,

100
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,190
no one else can lead you to her.

101
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,480
Even Zou Jun and Xu Haodong
never knew this.

102
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:39,600
How would you know?

103
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,800
Of course I know.

104
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,480
I disposed of her body
after she killed herself.

105
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:46,630
Talk.

106
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,360
Where did you hide my sister?

107
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,480
I'll make your death quick.

108
00:06:53,630 --> 00:06:54,480
I...

109
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,800
Your sister, she...

110
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,270
Don't move!

111
00:07:27,070 --> 00:07:27,750
Stay still!

112
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,430
Where's Yu Hongfei?

113
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,630
Didn't see him.

114
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,600
Let me go! I'll kill him!

115
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,630
I need revenge!

116
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:48,600
Stay put!

117
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,520
[Interrogation Room 3]

118
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,310
I wasn't planning to hide anything.

119
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,360
It's a shame.

120
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,310
I almost finished what I started.

121
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:27,190
You won't get to keep avenging her.

122
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:30,560
But you need to tell us the truth.

123
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,150
Everyone who hurt your sister

124
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,080
will be punished by law.

125
00:08:38,270 --> 00:08:40,790
I've always felt like I let her down.

126
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,630
My mother gave her
away after I was born.

127
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:47,960
At least she must've been happier

128
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:52,440
with her new family.

129
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,360
As a child, I loved girls' clothes,

130
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,200
dolls,

131
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,120
and playing house.

132
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,120
Because of that,

133
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:06,670
I got beaten a lot.

134
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,480
My family was deeply disappointed in me.

135
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,150
So your sister was the only one

136
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,480
who never rejected you.

137
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:17,150
Yeah.

138
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,440
Except for the sister
our parents abandoned,

139
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,840
no one else ever understood me.

140
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,120
Unfortunately,

141
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:27,360
when I was fifteen,

142
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:30,240
I never saw her again.

143
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:42,150
Sis?

144
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:42,910
Yeah?

145
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,600
What's that you're writing?

146
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,960
When you grow up,

147
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,910
you'll know when you get this letter.

148
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,600
Sis?

149
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:00,670
Why does my brother-in-law

150
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,000
always seem unhappy?

151
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,150
Did I cause you trouble again?

152
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,750
Of course not.

153
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,630
You're my biological brother.

154
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,960
Why would that be trouble?

155
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,320
But I can't stay with you much longer.

156
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:18,840
I still have something to do.

157
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,320
I'll take you out again next time.

158
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,920
[Time Post Office]
[To Jiang Li, seven years later]

159
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:29,600
[Time Post Office]

160
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,750
Seven years later,

161
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,790
I received the letter by chance.

162
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,790
Zou Jun used romance to lure her in,

163
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:40,630
then trafficked her

164
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,630
for profit.

165
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,320
That's why I hate him most.

166
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,120
My sister trusted him completely.

167
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,080
How could he do something like that?

168
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,670
So I wanted him to know

169
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,480
exactly why he had to die.

170
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:56,440
Next was Xu Haodong.

171
00:10:57,390 --> 00:10:58,550
He raped my sister

172
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,870
and forced her to take clients.

173
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,550
As for Yu Hongfei,

174
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:05,840
he pretended to care about her,

175
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,270
but he wanted the same thing.

176
00:11:11,630 --> 00:11:12,750
Whenever my sister refused to comply,

177
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,870
they beat her.

178
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,790
I couldn't let any of the three off.

179
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:23,240
Why didn't she ask you to call police?

180
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:26,440
Why write a letter due in seven years?

181
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,150
She feared her family
would face revenge.

182
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,840
Especially me.

183
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:31,960
They had all seen me.

184
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,960
And she felt ashamed.

185
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:39,320
When my sister wrote that letter,

186
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,480
she no longer wanted to live.

187
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:43,960
She had suffered too much.

188
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,440
She couldn't tell anyone.

189
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:48,150
She could only write it down.

190
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,270
She probably never imagined

191
00:11:51,870 --> 00:11:54,600
I'd actually receive
it seven years later.

192
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,630
Take a look.

193
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:06,320
Anything else to add?

194
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,960
Please ask Yu Hongfei

195
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:17,120
where he hid my sister's body.

196
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,440
After all these years,

197
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,960
wherever she's been in the dark,

198
00:12:23,150 --> 00:12:24,150
she must miss home.

199
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:26,790
Okay.

200
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:52,560
[Donglin City Public Security Bureau
Criminal Investigation Detachment]

201
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:00,960
Uncle He.

202
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:01,600
Hey?

203
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:01,960
Uncle He.

204
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:02,360
Hey?

205
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:13,910
Well.

206
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:16,440
Yu Hongfei's phone was detected abroad.

207
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:18,000
Someone must be helping him.

208
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,910
He's the only one who knows

209
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,320
where Xiao Ting's body is.

210
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,000
If we can't find him,

211
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,840
this case can never be fully closed.

212
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,960
This isn't just about the body.

213
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:32,440
There are still unresolved questions.

214
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:35,360
Go on.

215
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:36,870
Zou Jun and Xu Haodong

216
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,550
got out of prison,

217
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:39,870
but neither took a legitimate job.

218
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,480
Even Zou Jun's hidden-camera scheme

219
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,750
only began last year.

220
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,960
What did they live on before that?

221
00:13:46,790 --> 00:13:47,670
Everything we've found shows

222
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:49,670
they were never short of money.

223
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,480
So where did the money come from?

224
00:13:53,150 --> 00:13:54,440
Yu Hongfei is suspicious too.

225
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:57,790
Even if he used his brother's identity

226
00:13:57,790 --> 00:13:59,240
to avoid social stigma,

227
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:00,670
he never opened a phone

228
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:01,630
or bank account

229
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:03,550
using his own information.

230
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,440
He was far too cautious.

231
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:11,150
Xiao Ting's disappearance
is the most suspicious part.

232
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,790
If it was simply suicide,

233
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:16,200
even if they drove her to it,
a body can't speak.

234
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:18,840
They had no reason to go so far
to hide her body.

235
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:28,840
What happened at Night Flight Club
seven years ago?

236
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:38,480
Uncle Zhe...

237
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,080
Zhe...

238
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:42,440
Uncle Zhe, please let me go.

239
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:43,630
Uncle Zhe.

240
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:44,670
Please, I'm begging you.

241
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,240
Let me go.

242
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:48,240
Uncle Zhe, let me go.

243
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,080
Ah!

244
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,360
Don't yell like that.

245
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:57,200
I don't use that name anymore.

246
00:15:00,390 --> 00:15:00,870
Uncle Zhe.

247
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:02,120
Uncle Zhe.

248
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,480
Uncle Zhe, please!

249
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:08,840
Uncle Zhe.

250
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:47,890
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

251
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:49,830
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

252
00:15:49,830 --> 00:15:51,740
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

253
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:53,550
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

254
00:15:53,550 --> 00:15:55,890
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

255
00:15:55,890 --> 00:15:58,310
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

256
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:03,360
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

257
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,260
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

258
00:16:05,260 --> 00:16:07,200
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

259
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,330
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

260
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,340
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

261
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:13,500
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

262
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:20,570
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

263
00:16:20,570 --> 00:16:23,940
♪Why is that child crying?♪

264
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:26,640
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

265
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,260
♪Means I've grown up♪

266
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:31,410
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

267
00:16:31,410 --> 00:16:34,900
♪The wound still aches♪

268
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:39,660
♪Like a biting winter♪

269
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:42,920
♪But a spark still glows♪

